// PvP strings: single source of truth (X-macro). Column order = enum Lang: ES EN FR DE IT PT PL.
// X(id, maxlen, es, en, fr, de, it, pt, pl)
//   maxlen = longest allowed text on the round screen (formats: %u -> 2 digits, %s -> 10 chars,
//   checked by tests/i18n_tests.cpp; literals without a format are checked at compile time).
// ASCII only. A missing column or row is a compile error (wrong macro arity), never a null pointer.
// Spec: docs/pvp-integration-spec.md, section F.2.
//
// --- T4.2: card page, search, challenge, preparation, end / refusal ---
X(BTN_FIGHT, 20, "COMBATE ENTRENADOR", "TRAINER BATTLE", "COMBAT DRESSEUR", "TRAINERKAMPF", "SFIDA ALLENATORE", "BATALHA TREINADOR", "WALKA Z TRENEREM")
